{"repositoryId":1190007751,"availability":"available","full":"VanshikaGurbani/NutriPulse","name":"NutriPulse","description":"Nutrition tracker: type what you ate in plain English and get the calories and nutrients for each food. Built with Python and Streamlit.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-23T22:04:29Z","updated":"2026-10-18T00:25:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nutripulse.streamlit.app/","topics":["nutrition","nutrition-tracker","plotly","pytest","python","sqlite","streamlit"],"demo":"https://nutripulse.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.214Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.214Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.214Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.214Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["NutriPulse is a nutrition tracker built with Streamlit and two nutrition APIs. Type a natural phrase like \"2 cups white rice with carrots\" and it is split into ingredients, each with its own amount, calories and macros, which you can adjust before logging. It also tracks water and exercise, keeps your history, and shows insights against your own goals.","Built as a personal project, NutriPulse demonstrates API integration, a tested matching algorithm, a measured evaluation, and a UX redesign checked with before/after measurements.","Before/after screenshots of every tab at 375 px and 1280 px are in docs/ux/before and docs/ux/after."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VanshikaGurbani/NutriPulse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3261396d1e387084e6cf0b9d21b4d5222200b96a02a8209e45bd1c0266505625","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.337Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:46:20.337Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"NutriPulse is a nutrition tracker built with Streamlit and two nutrition APIs. Type a natural phrase like \"2 cups white rice with c